  "instructions": [
    "heat a large skillet over medium-high heat, add the avocado oil",
    "add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 4 minutes",
    "add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant",
    "add the halved plum tomatoes, cumin, and coriander, stir well",
    "cook the tomatoes for 6-8 minutes, stirring occasionally, until they are tender",
    "stir in the fresh lime juice, chopped cilantro, and salt",
    "serve the tomatoes warm, garnished with additional cilantro if desired",
    "warm tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20-30 seconds",
    "assemble the tacos by spooning the tomato mixture onto a tortilla and serving"
